---
layout: sub-navigation
title: Components
description: Each component, drawn live from its definition file, beside the app's own screenshots.
sectionKey: Components
order: 2
---
{#- Grouped as in the sidebar: by kind, then the proposed ones. -#}
{% for name, group in components | groupby("group") %}
<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">{{ name }}</h2>
{% if name == "Proposed components" %}
<p class="govuk-body">These aren’t in the app yet. They’re proposed, from designs for it, so they may change, or never ship.</p>
{% endif %}
<ul class="govuk-list">
  {% for component in group %}
  <li class="govuk-!-margin-bottom-6">
    <h3 class="govuk-heading-m govuk-!-margin-bottom-1"><a class="govuk-link" href="/components/{{ component.slug }}/">{{ component.name | escape }}</a></h3>
    <p class="govuk-body-s govuk-!-margin-bottom-1"><code>&lt;{{ component.element }}&gt;</code></p>
    <p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-bottom-0">{{ component.purpose | escape }}</p>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endfor %}
